title: Ukrainian refugees enter Germany en masse
new-page: true
on-arrival: 
tags: event
view-if: year = 2022 and month >= 5
max-visits: 1
face-image: img/ukraine_refugees.jpg
priority: 2

= Ukrainian refugee crisis

In the last two months, a total of more than half a million <span style="color: [+ ukraine_color_1 +];">**Ukra**</span><span style="color: [+ ukraine_color_2 +];">**inian**</span> refugees have entered Germany. The government has agreed to assign an additional billion to asylum costs, but many centers are still overwhelmed. Meanwhile, the <span style="color: [+ afd_color +];">far-right</span> will surely use the opportunity for fearmongering.

What should we do?

- @criticize
- @praise
- @campaign
- @against

@criticize
title: Criticize the government's actions.
subtitle: Their response to the crisis has only made the problem worse!
on-arrival: pragmatist_dissent += 1; beweli_strength += 2; emali_strength += 1; issue_migration += 1.25; urban_linke += 0.2*(1-dissent)*((10+newspapers)/10); youth_linke += 0.2*(1-dissent)*((10+social_media)/10); pro_status_quo -= 1*(10+newspapers+social_media)/10; east_afd += 1.5; urban_afd += 0.5; rural_afd += 1; upper_afd += 0.4; youth_afd += 0.5;

@praise
title: Praise the government's handling of the matter.
subtitle: They probably should have invested more though...
on-arrival: beweli_dissent += 3; oldleft_dissent += 3; pragmatist_strength += 2; issue_migration += 1; east_afd += 1.4; urban_afd += 0.4; rural_afd += 0.9; upper_afd += 0.3; youth_afd += 0.4; pro_status_quo += 1; spd_relation += 2; greens_relation += 2; fdp_relation += 0.5; urban_linke -= 0.1; youth_linke -= 0.1;

@campaign
title: Start a media campaign against <span style="color: [+ afd_color +];">AfD</span> propaganda.
subtitle: -1 resources.
view-if: oldleft_strength < 50
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: issue_migration += 0.95-(social_media/10+newspapers/20); east_afd += 1; urban_afd += 0.2; rural_afd += 0.7; upper_afd += 0.1; youth_afd += 0.2; pro_status_quo += 0.5; buenger_advisor_fame += 4;

@against
title: Criticize the government's open borders policy.
subtitle: After all, refugees only hurt the German worker.
view-if: oldleft_strength >= 5
on-arrival: issue_migration += 1.6; oldleft_dissent -= 5; social_moderation += 3; spd_relation -= 2; greens_relation -= 4; beweli_dissent += 15; emali_dissent += 10; pragmatist_dissent += 6; oldleft_strength += 6; pro_status_quo -= 1*(10+newspapers+social_media)/10; east_afd += 1.4; urban_afd += 0.4; rural_afd += 0.9; upper_afd += 0.3; youth_afd += 0.4; east_linke += 0.7*(1-dissent); rural_linke += 0.2*(1-dissent); wagenknecht_advisor_fame += 5; 
